// A float operation on a type parameter is a gap, never a checker panic, even in a body
// whose numeric bound is refused (it is still lowered).
// expect: refuse OWN-4 at 6:12
// expect: gap a float operation on a type parameter is not built
// expect: compared OWN-4 at 6:12 | float bound on a type parameter in package app | numeric bound on a core declaration's type parameter
fn root[F: float](x: F) -> F { float.sqrt(x) }
